    "detailed_description": "<h1>CHECK OUT OTHER GAMES</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670610/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.poster.avif?t=1712479701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670610/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.webm?t=1712479701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670610/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.mp4?t=1712479701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670610/extras/4507b40debdf678ed54f023edd795a5e.poster.avif?t=1712479701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670610/extras/4507b40debdf678ed54f023edd795a5e.webm?t=1712479701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>In the Old Norse written corpus, \u201cberserkers\u201d were those who were said to have fought in a trance-like fury.<br>Now, it\u2019s a time for you to become one of them - to be a great Viking warrior, you need to learn how to be a Berserker.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670610/extras/e941b24e8842f58eb90a06324ce7acf6.poster.avif?t=1712479701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670610/extras/e941b24e8842f58eb90a06324ce7acf6.webm?t=1712479701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Dark forces have opened the sky and come to our world, and it will be your job to stop all of them and send them back to where they came from.<br>Your journey will be full of different types of monsters and enemies!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670610/extras/c9a71ebf8c7add9fcf47eb1470672be7.poster.avif?t=1712479701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670610/extras/c9a71ebf8c7add9fcf47eb1470672be7.webm?t=1712479701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Did we mention that it will be super difficult? If not, please keep in mind that you\u2019ll need to use all your skills and learn new ones to reach the end.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670610/extras/bcf37d85ec1a1a972f3ef9d386e3624f.poster.avif?t=1712479701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670610/extras/bcf37d85ec1a1a972f3ef9d386e3624f.webm?t=1712479701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Each Viking warrior should know how to use properly their axe. It\u2019s time for you to learn how to use it too, like Thor - the God of war and fertility.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670610/extras/855160c7659dab6de81811e0020fbad7.poster.avif?t=1712479701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670610/extras/855160c7659dab6de81811e0020fbad7.webm?t=1712479701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>You\u2019ll use different combat weapons, from traditional ones to magic ones. And yes, archery will be involved too! You\u2019ll need all of that during your journey to the Northern lands.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670610/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.poster.avif?t=1712479701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670610/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.webm?t=1712479701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670610/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.mp4?t=1712479701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670610/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.poster.avif?t=1712479701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670610/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.webm?t=1712479701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670610/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.mp4?t=1712479701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670610/extras/4507b40debdf678ed54f023edd795a5e.poster.avif?t=1712479701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670610/extras/4507b40debdf678ed54f023edd795a5e.webm?t=1712479701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>In the Old Norse written corpus, \u201cberserkers\u201d were those who were said to have fought in a trance-like fury.<br>Now, it\u2019s a time for you to become one of them - to be a great Viking warrior, you need to learn how to be a Berserker.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670610/extras/e941b24e8842f58eb90a06324ce7acf6.poster.avif?t=1712479701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670610/extras/e941b24e8842f58eb90a06324ce7acf6.webm?t=1712479701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Dark forces have opened the sky and come to our world, and it will be your job to stop all of them and send them back to where they came from.<br>Your journey will be full of different 